## Notes

- The `HOMOGLYPH_MAP` in `scannerService.ts` covers Cyrillic, Greek, and common digit-letter substitutions (`0`→`o`, `1`→`l`, etc.)
- `SUSPICIOUS_TLDS` list: `.xyz`, `.top`, `.live`, `.club`, `.biz`, `.online`, `.cc`, `.info`, `.work`, `.click`, `.fit`, `.stream`, `.cfd`, `.quest`
- `SENSITIVE_KEYWORDS`: `login`, `signin`, `verify`, `secure`, `update`, `kyc`, `payment`, `refund`, `dispute`, `account`, `wallet`, `sso`, `auth`, `otp`, `billing`, `portal`, `claim`, `bonus`, `ebank`, `support`, `token`
- The chatbot widget is `z-index: 50` — it floats above all page content
- `SentinelChatbot.tsx` stores chat history in `DataContext` (persistent across views but cleared on `clearChatHistory()`)
